# The area map's path check (tools/automap_path.py, docs/AUTOMAP.md): the user's quick save compass-spirit
# (ELTALE_QUICK_LOAD_AT=100, out/bugsaves), then a walk on the field: stick right, up, left, down-left, up-right,
# then still. Start at 5 skips the intro to the title, where the quick load starts.
5 0x1000 0 0
7 0 0 0
160 0 80 0
260 0 0 80
420 0 -80 0
520 0 -60 -60
620 0 60 60
780 0 0 0
